WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.100
Yeah...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
I've been thinking of you a lot.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.320
Sendo, would you go out with me?

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.990
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.990
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.200
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibiku wa

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:21.200
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.460
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.460
I want to tell you, but I can't.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:29.460
Hatenai omoi ha anata...

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:29.460
I always long for you...

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.890
Boukansha no hibi ni yuuki wo dashitara sayonara

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:39.890
Say goodbye to the days of just being a bystander.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:48.940
Demo "jiyuu" no teigi ni buranko no you ni yureteru no ne?

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:48.940
But am I swaying over the meaning of "Freedom", like a swing?

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:54.070
Gosenfu ni kaita kaidan

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:54.070
Stairs drawn on a music score,

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:57.570
Ippo susunde niho sagattemo

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:57.570
Even if I go down one step and back two steps,

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:01.580
Honno chotto setsunasa utau

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:01.580
The notes play a sad melody.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.620
Watashi no real kanjite ne

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.620
Hear my reality!

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.540
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.540
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.090
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibikuwa

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.090
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:16.050
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:16.050
I want to tell you, but can't

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.470
Zutto anata wo sagashiteta

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.470
I've always been searching for you.

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:23.560
Tatoeba sou anataga hikari

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:23.560
Let's say you are the light

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.020
Watashi ga kagede mitsume aetanara

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.020
And I'm the shadow, gazing at one other.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:31.060
Namida iro no diamond

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:31.060
The tear-colored diamond

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:34.860
Nee zero kara kagayakasetai

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:34.860
I want to make it shine from nothing.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:40.410
Kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:40.410
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.580
Deaiwo...

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.580
Nor of meeting people...

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:48.080
Omen

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:51.920
I'm sorry.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.340
Figured you'd say that.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:58.380
I guess now I'm one of the guys shot down after asking you out.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:00.430
I'm really sorry.

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:01.850
Could you tell me why?

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:05.310
If you're going to turn me down, could you tell me why?

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:10.190
I have a rule.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:18.070
Loving or dating someone is something solely between humans.

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:23.620
Vice Prez.

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:27.960
What are you doing here?

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:31.380
N-Nothing particularly.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:39.050
Look.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:41.720
It's cute.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.430
Yeah?

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:44.930
It's an ordinary ladybug.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.730
It's nice because it's ordinary.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.480
There it goes.

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:57.820
It's for the best.

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:02.410
It feels better to fly free.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.620
It's so hot.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.130
Too hot.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:17.340
Good work, everyone.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:24.050
It's Sunday. All the other young people must be enjoying their great freedom.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:29.810
If you really think that, then don't suddenly talk about turning the first pool day into an event!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:36.440
These past few days have been hell organizing
the schedule and coming up with ideas for the event.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:42.280
The "power spot" for those who want to be in mutual relationships with the man in their heart...

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.570
What are you talking about?

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:48.080
It's a magazine Erika reads.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.500
The horoscope is pretty interesting.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.080
How is the compatibility between Sei and me?

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.920
It's obvious without checking it.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.250
The worst ever.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:01.880
Could you read mine?

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.510
Of course.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.220
And with whom would you like the reading to be with?

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.390
With Yukimaru.

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.650
Oh, okay.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.650
I'll check later.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:18.400
Thank you.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:22.280
So when is your birthday, Hasekura-kun?

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.950
Wouldn't you like to know your compatibility with Erika?

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:28.120
My compatibility with the Vice Prez?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.620
I'm not interested...

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:34.250
Let's see, Erika's birthday is June 7th, so...

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.380
She'd be a Gemini.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.750
June 7th?

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:41.130
That's today!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.510
Today's Vice Prez's birthday.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.760
Oh, it is?

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:47.470
Is that all?

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.970
How did you forget about such an important day?

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.810
Don't you celebrate it at all?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:53.930
We need to prepare a present, too.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:56.560
Unfortunately, our family doesn't practice events like that.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.320
I sense no sibling love.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:02.360
After all, we're immortal.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:07.740
We're never going to die, so what's there to celebrate about living another year?

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:13.790
Therefore, I don't think Erika cares that today's her birthday.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.580
Doesn't care?

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:21.590
But...

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.970
Come to think of it, the toilet brush needs to be replaced soon.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.810
Don't you agree, Sei?

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.220
Yes.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:36.640
This is a grave problem we have here.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:39.270
I need someone to run an errand.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.270
I'll go!

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:48.950
It's nice to be young.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.210
Where did Hasekura-kun run off to?

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:03.090
It's an emergency. He's gone to buy
a toilet brush from the shopping district.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:06.300
Huh? On a busy day like this?

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.890
Ready?

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.890
Scrub, scrub, scrub, scrub.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.650
It's almost the first day for the pool. I'm so excited.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.900
One two. One two. One two.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.280
It's summer, isn't it?

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.490
Why are Shiro and I out here, as well?

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:32.910
Helping the Cleaning Committee is part of our job, too.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:36.700
Besides, we need to help our hard working juniors.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.750
Right?

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:42.420
You went as far as telling him her birthday.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.420
Hey! You two there!

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:47.460
Stop slacking and help Hina-chan!

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:49.970
Otherwise, I'm going to give you disciplinary stickers!

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.760
Which one do you want?

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:54.100
Okay, here I go!

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.180
Scrub, scrub, rub, scrub, rub.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.180
President!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.180
Hi!

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.190
You're so cool!

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.150
Could you please help, too, Nii-sama?

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.780
Scrub, scrub. Scrub, scrub. Scrub, scrub.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:12.450
We should bump up the swim meet.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:15.080
It's usually held over summer break.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:18.290
Prez says some useful stuff once in a while.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:24.790
But to actually arrange it, we need to talk to the teachers and rearrange the schedule; it's quite a bit of work.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.050
We also need to prepare events.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:31.800
Regarding that, I came up with an idea for the main event.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.930
Although it's only an idea.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:36.890
You did all of this yourself?

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.680
Yeah, while I was watching TV.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.100
Since we're doing it, I want to make sure it's fun.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:45.860
You're starting to fit in here.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.480
Don't work too hard.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:50.530
Nothing.

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.200
Hello. This is Sushi Masa.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.870
A sushi delivery?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.910
It's for me. I ordered it.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.410
You're risking my well-being right now.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.120
I'll get in trouble if Sister sees me in this.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.630
Sorry. I'll make up for this later.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.050
A week's worth of lunches on you.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.050
Or maybe two?

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.260
That's a unique sushi package.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.390
Um...

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:19.680
Here.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:22.890
Open it.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:29.820
It's not rigged with something, is it?

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.070
Don't worry.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.320
Okay.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.450
Well in that case...

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.250
Happy birthday, Vice Prez.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.040
What? It's for me?

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.090
Who else is here?

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.840
What? Tomorrow?

00:08:54.840 --> 00:09:00.600
Yes. We arrange it after we get the order,
so the delivery will have to wait until tomorrow.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:04.560
If you will be here to pick it up,
I can give it to you by this evening.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.270
Evening, eh...

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.440
Hey, Kouhei.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:11.820
What are you doing?

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:16.660
So a generous delivery man brought it for me.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.500
Is it unwelcome?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.120
No, it's nothing like that.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:31.250
It's my first time receiving anything like this.

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.970
I feel like an ordinary girl.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:40.430
Thank you, Hasekura-kun.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:42.770
Yeah.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:47.900
I can't word this well, but... thank you.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.780
It smells so nice.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.280
Really, thank you so much.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.830
You said "thank you" three times.

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:05.290
Don't keep track of strange things like that.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.210
Well, shall we get back to work?

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:10.710
Yup. Let's take care of this!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.590
This one here.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:14.000
What do you think of...

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:21.260
I think it's got to be here.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.350
Now I need to think of where to put these.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.900
Oops, what am I doing?

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:37.150
Happy birthday.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.370
What... was that?

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:45.140
Pool Opening Day

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.310
Hey! Did yours get bigger again?

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:48.020
I bought a new swimsuit.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.270
Hey, we should go to the beach sometime.

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.520
Great idea! We should go with everyone.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.650
Is something wrong, Shiro?

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.330
No, it's nothing.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.620
You don't have to worry!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:13.040
When you grow up, I'm sure you'll become a sexy woman just like me.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.540
I'll do my best.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.710
Kirikiri. So you're not skipping class today?

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.510
Because a certain someone nags.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:24.510
Are you talking about Kouhei-kun?

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.600
Anyway, good girl.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:43.650
Organizing the Pool Opening Day and the swim meet on the same day.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.570
The Student Council had the right idea.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:50.580
Yes. To use their young power in sports.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.500
This is what youth is all about.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.670
Why isn't she in a swimsuit?

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:56.170
No fair, Sister.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.790
You're cruel.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.840
What unhealthy youth.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.510
Well, they're filled with young power.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.220
They all look excited.

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:07.300
Don't you think, Hasekura-kun?

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.100
Y-Yeah.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.970
At this rate, the last bit should be more exciting.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.480
Hi, everyone!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:21.730
Be sure to witness my manliness.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.780
Burn it into your eyes.

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:28.910
Burn it.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:31.790
Burn it!!!

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.460
That's enough!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.340
Gosh, that brother of mine.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.090
He does make the event entertaining in many ways.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.720
Hey there. Having fun yet?

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:48.430
Hey.

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:49.720
Do you have something?

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:52.220
No, we're just here to say hi.

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:53.770
And here's a gift.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.230
Thank you, Yuki-san.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.190
I was just getting thirsty.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:01.110
It's really hot just watching things.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.610
You two won't be swimming?

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:06.650
We're the organizers this time.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:09.530
So as the stage crew, we have to make sure it all goes smoothly.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:10.780
I see.

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.330
If there's anything we can do, let us know.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:13.490
The disciplinary committee will take action.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:15.660
Thank you very much.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.710
Count on me.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.920
You're in the next event.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.790
All right, I'm so getting first place.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:24.250
Watch me, Hina-chan.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.260
See ya!

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.880
See you later, Kouhei-kun, Sendo-san.

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:31.640
They really get along, don't they?

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:33.010
Yeah, definitely.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:34.260
Let's dig in.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:37.430
Oh yeah.

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:42.730
I thought we wouldn't have time to eat lunch because of our duties.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:44.150
Here.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:45.780
Are you sure?

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.190
Thank you.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.150
I'm actually starving.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.120
It's good!

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.410
Really?

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.620
That's great.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.120
You should eat, too.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:14:59.920
Yup.

00:15:03.590 --> 00:15:05.090
Yaskisoba sandwich?

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:07.800
Is this...

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.190
Oh well.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.690
The blue sky is gone!

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:33.280
It's been overtaken by the bright sun!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:36.740
The inter-class water tag event is about to begin!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.790
If you want the prize, free lunch tickets,

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:49.130
you must protect your hat for five minutes from these judo masters I've gathered!

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:52.880
The taggers are all from the judo club?

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:55.470
Kanade-san likes these kinds of events.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.640
Maybe I shouldn't have asked her to help.

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:59.270
Okay then.

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:01.270
Ready...

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.520
Go!

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:13.240
Come on! Is that all you got?!

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:21.460
Oh no! The judo masters locked on to a beauty.

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:24.620
Competitor Kuze Kiriha is in a pinch!

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:30.800
Where did she go?

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:31.420
She's gone.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:45.600
Nice going, Kirikiri! You're amphibious!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:47.770
Wow, Kuze-san.

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.150
She's going to take the tickets away.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:51.990
The one other person remaining is...

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.570
Oh my! It's Togi Shiro-chan!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:00.490
Shiro...

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:02.700
Oh no.

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:07.630
P-P-Please don't come near me!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.420
No!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:15.970
No! Please go away.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:19.260
The cute girl wins!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.010
You're all good boys, judo club.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:24.520
Time's up!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.100
Shiro-chan and Kirikiri win!

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.980
This year's inter-class water tag-

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.480
Guys! Today's special!

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:33.740
It's your chance to settle grudges!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:37.490
Hey, you guys!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.910
No! Stop it!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.500
Yay!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.670
I said enough already!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.220
I'm glad it all ended well.

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:59.140
I'm not so sure about the last bit though.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:02.180
I want my brother to reflect upon his actions a bit.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:06.890
But, Prez is the President because he's like that.

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:08.440
Is that a compliment?

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.650
Uh...

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:11.440
Not sure.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.490
Okay, let's clean up.

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:17.490
Can you hold that side?

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:18.240
Yeah.

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:19.490
There we go.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:23.330
Look. It's the Vice Prez and Hasekura-senpai.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.250
They look nice together.

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.920
They're more like partners rather than a couple.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.920
I'm jealous.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.800
Partners...

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:55.980
Vice Prez?

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:59.450
Events end in a flash, don't they?

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.290
Want to swim?

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.410
Let's race.

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:12.250
No one's here, so it won't hurt to take little dip.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.540
But...

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:18.420
You said we'd be the stage crew, but in school life, we're part of the cast, too.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:20.680
Right?

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:23.850
You're right.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:30.770
On your marks.

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:32.190
Ready...

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:34.690
Go!

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:07.010
Wow, you're fast.

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:09.560
I went easy on you, too.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.690
I'll win next time.

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:15.860
I'll accept your challenge anytime.

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.590
Vice Prez...

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:40.590
Hasekura-kun...

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.310
I'm sorry.

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.440
Vice Prez!

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:02.990
Let-

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.580
It's nothing.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.960
I guess I'm a little tired.

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:18.170
I'm sorry, I'm going ahead.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:24.300
Vice Prez...

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:44.190
Blood...

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:46.780
I want blood...

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:55.250
No. It's my rule...

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.750
I... I...

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:09.340
Hasekura-kun...

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:29.950
I miss you

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:29.950
I miss you.

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:50.090
Mabushii kurai e ni kaita jikan nano

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:50.090
Just like in a perfect painting,

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:54.850
Sou ima ha...

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:54.850
Now is a dazzling moment.

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:08.900
Kawari hajimeta machinami ni me wo sorashi

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:08.900
I look away from the city that's starting to change

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:14.620
Omoide ha tada iuno

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:14.620
And my memories whisper to me, saying,

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:21.750
Soko de tomadou dake

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:21.750
You're only at a loss.

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:23.750
I miss you

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:28.010
Omoi wo sono mama dakishimete

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:28.010
Hold on to your feelings.

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:29.920
I miss you

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:34.260
Kawaranu omoi wo shiritai no

00:23:29.920 --> 00:23:34.260
I want to know how you've always felt.

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:36.140
I miss you

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:39.890
Negatteru kara

00:23:36.140 --> 00:23:39.890
I'll always long for you, so...

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:45.900
I miss you...

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:57.870
This is why I said you should put sunscreen on.

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:02.500
June's UV rays are not to be taken lightly.

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:05.710
No looking!

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:21.560
Eighth Episode

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:21.560
「Memory」

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:09.050
Shadow lurking in the darkness.

00:24:09.050 --> 00:24:09.920
Who are you?

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.260
Darkness hidden in the heart.

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:14.430
That's me.

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:16.680
When darkness and darkness mix,

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:19.560
the door of truth makes a noise.
